CM_ SG_ 258 A102_CONTEXT_BIT11 "0x102 bit 11. Changes once from zero to one on each recorded drive. Exact operational meaning unresolved; context metadata only; not geometry, validity, quality, lifecycle, publication, selection, or candidate generation.";
