CM_ SG_ 258 A102_CONTEXT_BIT14 "0x102 bit 14. Persistent event/context bit with multiple transitions on the recorded drives. It does not transfer as Toyota cruise, brake, or main-state truth; context metadata only; not geometry, validity, quality, lifecycle, publication, selection, or candidate generation.";
