CM_ SG_ 528 A210_RSA_SPEED_LIMIT_VALUE8 "0x210 byte 1. Across drives, replica of Toyota RSA1.SPDVAL1 above 99.9 percent agreement. Unit is selected externally by RSA2.SPDUNT; not ego speed or radar range.";
CM_ SG_ 528 A210_B2 "0x210 byte 2. Raw startup residue; zero except one recorded short-route startup frame.";
