CM_ SG_ 565 A235_B0_CHECK_BYTE "0x235 byte 0. Deterministic check/context byte, but the general affine family retains 160 unique-tail counterexamples across the recorded drives; unresolved and not geometry, validity, quality, lifecycle, publication, selection, identity, or candidate generation.";
CM_ SG_ 565 A235_STATUS_MUX4 "0x235 byte-1 low nibble. Legacy signal name; observed values are persistent context states, not a demonstrated cycling mux. Value 1 selects the shared companion-tail idle state of 0x235, 0x237 and 0x23B, matching that state at rate 1.0 on the recorded drives (68,722/87,640 and 193,090/556,592 frames); while it holds, those tail bytes carry a fixed payload rather than content. This is frame-local payload availability, not object validity. Retained as observed context only; not lifecycle, validity, publication, selection, quality, candidate-generation, or geometry truth.";
CM_ SG_ 565 A235_COUNTER4 "0x235 byte-1 high nibble. Retained as observed rolling sync/loss metadata only.";
CM_ SG_ 567 A237_B0_CHECK_BYTE "0x237 byte 0. Exact affine parity check candidate over bytes 1..DLC-1 on the recorded drives; OEM CRC/check name remains unknown and third-route validation is required; not geometry, validity, quality, lifecycle, publication, selection, identity, or candidate generation. Combined-fit input rank 50/57; long-to-short fitting misses one unique tail. Exactness uses a combined-route fit, not independent held-out validation of a unique algorithm. Behavior outside the observed input span is unidentified; do not use this candidate to reject incoming frames.";
CM_ SG_ 567 A237_STATUS_MUX4 "0x237 byte-1 low nibble. Legacy signal name; observed values are persistent context states, not a demonstrated cycling mux. Retained as observed context only; not lifecycle, validity, publication, selection, quality, candidate-generation, or geometry truth.";
CM_ SG_ 567 A237_COUNTER4 "0x237 byte-1 high nibble. Retained as observed rolling sync/loss metadata only.";
CM_ SG_ 569 A239_B0_CHECK_BYTE "0x239 byte 0. Exact affine parity check candidate over bytes 1..DLC-1 on the recorded drives; OEM CRC/check name remains unknown and third-route validation is required; not geometry, validity, quality, lifecycle, publication, selection, identity, or candidate generation. Combined-fit input rank 44/57; short-to-long unique-tail accuracy is only 0.5785229255, while long-to-short fitting misses one unique tail. Exactness uses a combined-route fit, not independent held-out validation of a unique algorithm. Behavior outside the observed input span is unidentified; do not use this candidate to reject incoming frames.";
CM_ SG_ 569 A239_STATUS_MUX4 "0x239 byte-1 low nibble. Legacy signal name; observed values are persistent context states, not a demonstrated cycling mux. Value 7 selects the same shared companion-tail idle state as A235_STATUS_MUX4 == 1, at rate 1.0 on the recorded drives. 0x239 itself has no idle tail and is free-running. Retained as observed context only; not lifecycle, validity, publication, selection, quality, candidate-generation, or geometry truth.";
CM_ SG_ 569 A239_COUNTER4 "0x239 byte-1 high nibble. Retained as observed rolling sync/loss metadata only.";
CM_ SG_ 571 A23B_B0_CHECK_BYTE "0x23B byte 0. Exact affine parity check candidate over bytes 1..DLC-1 on the recorded drives; OEM CRC/check name remains unknown and third-route validation is required; not geometry, validity, quality, lifecycle, publication, selection, identity, or candidate generation. Combined-fit input rank 14/17; long-to-short fitting misses one unique tail. Exactness uses a combined-route fit, not independent held-out validation of a unique algorithm. Behavior outside the observed input span is unidentified; do not use this candidate to reject incoming frames. Compact operating-frame candidate: MSB-first CRC8 poly 0x1D init 0 over B1,B2, XOR 0x59, then XOR 0x3B/0x76/0xEC/0xC5 for set bits 4/5/6/7 of B1. Both route-trained rules agree: 644230 operating frames match; two startup 000FFF frames predict 0x3E instead of 0x00. Startup handling unresolved. Evidence: data/derived/ars510_23x_crc_structure/report.md.";
CM_ SG_ 571 A23B_STATUS_MUX4 "0x23B byte-1 low nibble. Legacy signal name; observed constant zero on 556,592/556,592 long-route and 87,638/87,640 short-route frames, the two exceptions being power-on frames, so this is a legacy name for a reserved nibble and it carries no status on the recorded evidence. Retained as observed context only; not lifecycle, validity, publication, selection, quality, candidate-generation, or geometry truth.";
CM_ SG_ 571 A23B_COUNTER4 "0x23B byte-1 high nibble. Retained as observed rolling sync/loss metadata only.";
